<% layout("../layouts/auth") %>
<h1>Setup not configured</h1>
<p class="lede gate-lede">No passkey is enrolled and no setup secret is configured, so this deployment cannot be unlocked yet.</p>
<p class="note">Set <code>ADMIN_SETUP_SECRET</code> in your hosting configuration and redeploy, then return to <code>/setup</code> to enroll a passkey.</p>
<div class="gate-foot">
  <p class="note">Published Drafts and Assets are unaffected and stay public.</p>
</div>
